  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Primary Path",
      "items": [
        "Mobile client sends a Bearer-token request to the Express API.",
        "JWT middleware verifies signature, access-token type, and the current user token_version.",
        "The personal controller validates a transaction and writes through its Supabase repository."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Receipt Scan",
      "items": [
        "Receipt scan accepts multipart receipt images or JSON base64 and returns parsed values; it does not create a transaction.",
        "OCR uses a reusable Tesseract worker for Thai and English. Anthropic repair is enabled only when configured and the result needs it.",
        "Slip uploads are MIME-whitelisted, size-limited to 8 MB, randomly named, and served only from uploads/slips."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Authentication And Limits",
      "items": [
        "Public auth routes apply IP and OTP rate limit middleware; state is Redis-backed only when REDIS_URL is configured.",
        "OTP email uses Gmail SMTP when credentials are present; otherwise the development fallback logs the code.",
        "CORS allows configured origins only; default development origins are localhost:5173 and localhost:8081."
      ]
    }
  ]
